git -C "$W" rev-parse HEAD; git -C "$W" status --porcelain
git -C "$W" log --reverse --stat --format='%h %ad %s' origin/main..HEAD   # plan file? tests before code?
```

**2. Write** `<scratch>/msg-rdp-lang-evidence.txt`, then **Bash, background**

