**4. Backlog:** I edit `orchestrator/backlog.md`, run `build-backlog.sh` and republish the Artifact. The task stays at stage 6, with next step "evidence and validation at 4ba90e0, then code review" and blocked-on "executor evidence".

**5. Status to the operator** (the manifest asks for Russian; this session is set to English)

> **rdp-lang is reported, not verified.** Nothing is merged and nothing has changed on ccs-it or any other host.
>
> - **Now:** I am re-running the tests and ansible-lint (the Ansible style checker) myself at commit 4ba90e0, and I have asked the executor for proof. Its "idempotent re-run: changed=0" (a second run that changes nothing) cannot stand as written, because executors have no host access.
> - **Next:** an independent review by a fresh Claude session, then your merge poll with the findings. After that the advisors vote on the canary, and I deploy from merged main.
